{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34444","headline":"送润卿还华阳 · 陆龟蒙","name":"送润卿还华阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事轻舟近腊回，茅家兄弟欲归来。\n封题玉洞虚无奏，点检霜坛沆瀣杯。\n云肆先生分气调，山图公子爱词才。\n殷勤爲向东乡荐，洒扫含真雪後台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}